  "changes": {
    "package.json": "Replace only the vulnerable fast-glob runtime dependency with exact glob13.0.6; omit upstream development-only dependencies from the local file package. Package version/name and all44 exported rule implementation files remain at16.4.0.",
    "dist/utils/get-root-dirs.js": "Migrate only the Next root-directory consumer to glob13; preserve directories-only, followed symlinks, absolute/relative prefixes, explicit trailing slash and trailing globstar semantics. Negated extglob includes dot paths as upstream did. Frozen parity fixtures validate results and no-html-link-for-pages diagnostics; this is not a general fast-glob shim."
  },
